-- TYPE MISMATCH ---------- errors/type_mismatch_59.march

expected `Scope` but got `Result(Scope, ScopeError)`. [type_mismatch]

6 |     restrict IO.NetConnect(host, methods(get)) do
                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

    A computed scope expression can fail, so `restrict` cannot take it directly. Bind it with `let?` first: `let? s = IO.NetConnect(host, methods(get))`, then `restrict s do ... end`.
